    "evidence": "Strong cyber-lab art direction, disciplined cyan/red/yellow semantics, polished cards, and a clear ROI focal point. However, desktop composition is excessively left-heavy with large unused space; tablet headline wrapping feels awkward; mobile is very dense and several labels/body lines are tiny and low-contrast. The global header also looks clipped and incomplete at tablet/mobile widths, weakening polish and navigation hierarchy.",
